# Committed default configuration for this repo.
#
# This file IS committed; the working .env (a copy made by `make setup`) is
# git-ignored. Both the Makefile and CI read .env first, then fall back to this
# file — so this is the language CI and a fresh clone see. Edit LANGUAGE here
# (and commit) to change the repo's language; edit your local .env to override
# just your machine.
#
# Built-in languages: python | r (case-insensitive). To add another (e.g.
# julia), add an adapter block in the Makefile and a CI job in
# .github/workflows/test.yml — see the seam comments there.
LANGUAGE=python
